brain-runtime (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging: /usr/bin wrappers, Python library in python3
    dist-packages, scripts and templates in /usr/share/brain. Built from the
    canonical source tree by runtime/packaging/build-deb.sh (dpkg-deb, no
    fpm/debhelper toolchain).
  * brain_core.version reads the package version from dpkg-query when
    importlib.metadata is blank; brain-status shows Core as dpkg:brain-runtime.
  * Federation multi-user readiness (node identity, lock-conflict guard,
    deterministic wiki/log.md and task-queue merge on sync).

